WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.170
 Marvel fans, I am
here with Marisa Tomei.

00:00:02.170 --> 00:00:03.240
How's it going?
- Hi.

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:04.170
Going good.

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:06.870
Getting very excited for
everyone to see this movie.

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:08.790
It's the big-- the big opening.

00:00:08.790 --> 00:00:10.360
 The energy is amazing.

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:11.490
I'm so excited.

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:13.800
 Yeah, it's-- it's very--
it's really thrilling.

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:18.300
 So what has May been up
to since we last left off?

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:20.280
 Well-- well, her-- her
and Peter Parker have

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:21.480
gone through a lot together.

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:23.100
They're growing up.

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:25.410
They've been through
several cycles

00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:27.960
of on and off relationships
with other people.

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:29.590
[LAUGHTER]

00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:30.390
I don't know.

00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:31.300
They're hanging out.

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:32.100
[LAUGHTER]

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:33.240
 I mean, that's a lot.

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:34.050
 Uh-huh.

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:36.630
 So everyone knows that
Peter Parker is Spider-Man.

00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:38.610
How is May handling that?

00:00:38.610 --> 00:00:41.760
 I think that-- well-- well,
May was shocked at first.

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:44.910
And-- and then, you
know, then she found out.

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:46.830
And they became a team.

00:00:46.830 --> 00:00:48.540
They just really work together.

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:51.870
And she's in on it with him.

00:00:51.870 --> 00:00:53.640
And she also tries
to protect the part

00:00:53.640 --> 00:00:56.760
of him that's still a boy
and lets him do his thing.

00:00:56.760 --> 00:00:57.820
INTERVIEWER: I love that.

00:00:57.820 --> 00:01:00.780
So I need you to spill
the tea, all right?

00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:03.840
May has, kind of, a different
understanding when it comes

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:07.740
to her relationship with Happy.

00:01:07.740 --> 00:01:09.630
What-- is there a
relationship there?

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:10.710
What's going on?

00:01:10.710 --> 00:01:11.610
 I don't-- I don't think--

00:01:11.610 --> 00:01:12.810
I mean, there's a relationship.

00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:13.800
There's a friendship.

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:16.350
And they've also--
they're, like, compadres.

00:01:16.350 --> 00:01:17.920
They've been through
so much together.

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:19.350
They've been lovers.
They've been friends.

00:01:19.350 --> 00:01:20.760
They've been on.
They've been off.

00:01:20.760 --> 00:01:23.250
I don't know why you think
I have a different-- why?

00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:24.780
Do you have a different
understanding?

00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:27.070
 Well, I mean, the last
movie, it was, kind of, like,

00:01:27.070 --> 00:01:27.910
a little back and--
- Oh.

00:01:27.910 --> 00:01:29.190
Oh, yeah.
Yes.

00:01:29.190 --> 00:01:29.990
Yes.

00:01:29.990 --> 00:01:31.420
Yes, true.

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:33.630
 What was it like to work with
this incredible cast again?

00:01:33.630 --> 00:01:36.990
 Oh, it's just so great
to see-- to see them.

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:39.180
They're always doing
something new and different.

00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:40.950
And they-- they just--

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:41.753
they're so beautiful.

00:01:41.753 --> 00:01:42.720
They're beautiful to look at.

00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:43.860
They're beautiful inside.

00:01:43.860 --> 00:01:48.230
And it's always fun to come
back and be with them again.

00:01:48.230 --> 00:01:50.130
 Well, I'm excited to see
you on the big screen tonight.

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:51.420
I won't keep you
from the red carpet.

00:01:51.420 --> 00:01:52.660
Thank you for
spending time with us.

00:01:52.660 --> 00:01:53.670
 Thanks.
Thanks to you.

00:01:53.670 --> 00:01:56.720
[MUSIC PLAYING]

